{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Out_type.Ident_names</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"melange","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Melange_compiler_libs","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Out_type","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Ident_names","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Disambiguation for identifiers, e.g. the two type constructors named <code>t</code> in the type of <code>f</code> in</p><pre class=\"language-ocaml\"><code>  type t = A\u000A  module M = struct\u000A    type t = B\u000A   let f A = B\u000A  end</code></pre><p>should be disambiguated to <code>t/2-&gt;t</code></p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-enable\"><a href=\"#val-enable\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> enable: <span>bool <span class=\"arrow\">=&gt;</span></span> unit;</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>When contextual names are enabled, the mapping between identifiers and names is ensured to be one-to-one.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-with_fuzzy\"><a href=\"#val-with_fuzzy\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> with_fuzzy: <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ident</span>.t <span class=\"arrow\">=&gt;</span></span> <span><span>(<span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">=&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">=&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span>;</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>with_fuzzy id f</code> locally disable ident disambiguation for <code>id</code> within <code>f</code></p></div></div>"}